                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "077f5b13-0e46-38ce-a158-54cfd7027210",
                                        "entry_id": "634b613e-4025-3b71-a5eb-ddb8fe38a0a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A monosyllabic vowel combination usually involving a quick but smooth movement from one vowel to another that passes over a third one."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d7de5b96-c7b5-30f0-814d-e29eadf55050",
                                        "entry_id": "634b613e-4025-3b71-a5eb-ddb8fe38a0a2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A disyllabic sequence of a vowel, a semivowel, and a vowel."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "36abb2f9-5f20-467d-a4bf-d602ae1c4074",
                                                "sense_id": "d7de5b96-c7b5-30f0-814d-e29eadf55050",
                                                "text": "Before moving on to a solution, it may be worth emphasizing that nouns of the صلوه type originally contained a triphthong. […] In addition to evidence from the Safaitic inscriptions, the discovery of the Graeco-Arabic inscription A1 (Al-Jallad and al-Manaser 2015), where the verb ’tw ‘he came’ is written αθαοα /’atawa/, confirms this to be the case for Old Arabic as well."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2b919bd0-6483-4c18-b8f4-d97a3f5c3644",
                        "source_entry_id": "40ddcf55-2b67-3f08-a1f5-7f052c37eb51",
                        "source_sense_id": "0d394024-00c7-3b4d-b27f-386fe5deb6e8",
                        "target_lang_word": "triphtongue",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "triphtongue",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d12313fd-906d-3522-b693-ef7b79189d3a",
                                        "entry_id": "97cb7f96-6581-387a-b37e-a8a0a531c6ed",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Syllabe composée de trois voyelles qu’on prononce d’une seule émission de voix."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0f01eb37-6b48-499c-9fd8-848c879a26df",
                                                "sense_id": "d12313fd-906d-3522-b693-ef7b79189d3a",
                                                "text": "Ai ou la fausse triphtongue eai, en un seul son, remplace dans les terminaisons le groupe français eau, auquel correspond le bourguignon et le poitevin â, éa, ià."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e140113c-e8eb-4769-a2cb-2dda6d8fe78b",
                                                "sense_id": "d12313fd-906d-3522-b693-ef7b79189d3a",
                                                "text": "Eu égard à mon activité, la seule majusculisation de mes nom et prénom suffirait. DICK LAPELOUSE. Pas de chichi, pas de truc emberlificoté avec des termes en triphtongues pour définir la raison sociale."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
